AB  - With the rapid development of science and technology and the continuous integration of the global economy, the external environment faced by enterprises is becoming increasingly complex and changeable, and risk management has become an important guarantee for the sustainable development of enterprises. The rapid development of artificial intelligence (AI)technology has provided a new perspective and tool for risk management. This paper aims to discuss the application of AI-based risk management framework in the complex environment, analyze its advantages, challenges and implementation strategies, and provide reference for enterprises to effectively manage risks in the complex and changeable market environment.
